title: "Groundhog: agent reliability on medical-evidence tasks"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark measuring whether tool-using AI agents complete realistic
  medical-evidence tasks consistently across repeated runs, under injected
  tool faults, and without unsafe behaviour.
